    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμφορα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα ἀπὸ τῶν ἱερῶν ἐκφέρεσθαι ὁ νόμος
			κωλύει,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφύνειν:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔξειν, σεμνύνειν, ἐντιμότερον
		ποιεῖν,</span> Id., cf. <i><span class="en">
			Phot.
		</span></i> (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤμφυναν.</span>) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμῶλαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, 
			Dor.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμαῦλαξ</span> (q.v.).</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
